      "description": {
        "fun": "Mime Jr. loves imitating others, though it isn't very good at it yet. It copies a foe's moves to confuse it, then slips away, but it sometimes gets so pleased with itself that it forgets to keep the act going. It likes busy places like markets, and in Galar it idolises the tap-dancing Mr. Rime and practises its steps.",
        "guide": "A small, pink Psychic and Fairy baby Pokémon introduced in Generation 4 that loves to imitate others. It evolves into Mr. Mime when levelled up knowing Mimic, or into Galarian Mr. Mime if it evolves in Galar. It was pure Psychic before Generation 6.",
