      "description": {
        "fun": "Mr. Mime is a born pantomime artist, and it's not just pretending: by vibrating its fingertips, it solidifies air into real invisible walls. It doesn't take kindly to anyone who interrupts its act or isn't impressed, and slaps them. It's such a good mime that it's hard to tell whether it's asleep or just pretending to be. Before Generation 3, its name had no space: Mr.Mime.",
        "guide": "A humanoid Psychic and Fairy Pokémon that is a skilled mime, able to make invisible walls by solidifying the air with its fingertips. It evolves from Mime Jr. and was pure Psychic before Generation 6. Its Galarian form is an Ice and Psychic type that evolves into Mr. Rime.",
        "tagline": "A mime whose invisible walls are actually there",
