        "zh-Hant": "踏冰人偶"
      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Mr. Rime tap-dances with an ice cane and a comical routine that's so popular Galar's Mime Jr. copy its steps. The act is a trap, though: the moment an opponent laughs, it blasts them with air at −200°C. Its face hardly moves, but the 'face' pattern on its belly changes to show its feelings. Its bowler-hat look recalls the Tramp of silent films.",
        "guide": "An Ice and Psychic Pokémon introduced in Generation 8, the evolution of Galarian Mr. Mime. It tap-dances with a cane made of ice and releases psychic power through the pattern on its belly. Its look is based on a mime, a tap dancer and a silent-film comedian.",
